        <footnote id="F6">These restricted stock units vest in equal installments on March 1, 2025, March 1, 2026, and March 1, 2027.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F7">These restricted stock units vest in equal installments on March 1, 2026, March 1, 2027, and March 1, 2028.</footnote>
